Subject: [PATCH] Tabbed home page: Overview, GitHub, Contact

- index.md: x-data="{ tab: 'overview' }" wrapper with x-show panels;
  GitHub tab includes README.md, Contact tab holds the contact modal
- assets/js/site.js: tabFromHash() keeps the tab in the URL and opens the
  right tab for links to headings inside it
- assets/css/style.scss: terminal-style tab bar, fade-in panels;
  top-align table cells inside scroll frames

